    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b177cd25e56f794d1de217a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵……谢谢你今年也展现了这么灿烂的笑容♪\n为了看到这张笑脸，无论让我付出多少努力都值得。\n所以……明年也请继续期待哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4303b5a181428e74ef4c181792661b8eea906ed7317597cb22dabb088ba2853b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
