      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "礼物的意图，看来你已经心领神会了呢。\n那么，就请回应我的这份心意吧。\n……可别让我丢脸哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0998ceabeb73eb67d22c1e104d62730b59553c0eb8cc042ab10d79c42e4190e6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
