    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec46b1d0ac163db6b1c2ee17",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "送给你的巧克力，说实话，\n我还真不知道该叫什么名字好呢。\n……那就叫它，多亏有你让我依靠巧克力吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07271d19fa1b77aac2db73dae00567e8a28fb99bb2b1005d0e952a4f184de619",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
