    {
      "uid": "zhcn:446b71b815c04c433e5265c9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵……你还真是，\n总是这么坦率地接受我的心意呢。\n…………确实，非常有你的风格。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d57f5d09c5843656aa9ada30053a7ed3b59a605d02a55b55ec21b9d27b6bdaa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
