      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4ac1a74745e2cd9828eaf41",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "咳，咳嗯……虽然看起来可能稍微有些朴素，\n但对我来说，这就是最美味的形式了。\n……总、总之，请务必品尝一下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "86dad9c4746e8381e222dcd0f8cef120f29da6bb45b71f5651705a9d0a799946",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
