    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f3fa060d46aab406dad1c30",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其实这个呀，直径足足有0.0001英里呢！\n我会以1英里为目标……明年、后年，\n也会一直、一直——送给你的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b351acda90fdc1d83d7dcd22f0886df43313435eda635d465f4acd9a9ff64b11",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
