    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a808c7c40abdc17ec605795",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呼呼，今天真是最棒的一天呢！\n无论看向哪里，都满溢着爱意。\n当然，在这里也是一样……对吧♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "c28d11616dcb6d5790af3332258447a922ae353ee90ac3f375c2d105938de312",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
